  "courseSlug": "css-the-complete-guide-incl-flexbox-grid-sass",
  "courseTitle": "CSS - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "9669504",
      "title": "Rotating Elements and setting transform-origin",
      "lectureOrder": 243,
      "videoOrder": 220,
      "sourceHash": "ea7e39053b9be4064ea222bcd7c5259209d0a25c34ed6a466c754136e8770072",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.17,
          "end": 4.69,
          "en": "Now to dive into CSS transformations,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.72,
          "end": 10.84,
          "en": "I'm back in our project and now I want to transform this badge, this recommended badge we have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11,
          "end": 12.56,
          "en": "We can rotate it and so on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.56,
          "end": 15.02,
          "en": "and that is exactly what we'll start with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.02,
          "end": 20.51,
          "en": "So back in our code, let's go into the packages folder and there in the packages.css file and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.51,
          "end": 24.49,
          "en": "there, we have this package badge class or this class selector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.5,
          "end": 27.08,
          "en": "Now right now, the badge is positioned with position",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.08,
          "end": 29.57,
          "en": "absolute and top right zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.57,
          "end": 32.04,
          "en": "it has a margin of 1.2rem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.06,
          "end": 38.72,
          "en": "First of all, let's change that margin to zero so that we have no margin on this element anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.9,
          "end": 41.41,
          "en": "it now sits directly in the top right corner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.42,
          "end": 48.59,
          "en": "Now this is no transformation, transformations are applied with a special property, the transform",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 48.59,
          "end": 50,
          "en": "property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 50.03,
          "end": 56.72,
          "en": "Now we got a couple of key transformations and that are moving the element, which we of course also can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 56.72,
          "end": 63.14,
          "en": "do with the help of top right and for non-absolute elements, we also can move an element with the margin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 63.14,
          "end": 64.24,
          "en": "for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 64.55,
          "end": 67.44,
          "en": "but this actually is hardware accelerated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 67.73,
          "end": 70.33,
          "en": "and it keeps the element in the document flow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 70.43,
          "end": 75.39,
          "en": "Well, not for this element because position absolute but for a normal element it would.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 75.59,
          "end": 81.2,
          "en": "So moving the element with transformations is always a good idea if you really just want to move it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 81.25,
          "end": 81.93,
          "en": "visually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 82.13,
          "end": 87.19,
          "en": "I want to start with a different transformation though, not with moving the element but with rotating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 87.26,
          "end": 92.96000000000001,
          "en": "and for that, let's use rotateZ. I'll dive into the other options later in this module when we dive into 3D",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 92.96000000000001,
          "end": 94.46000000000001,
          "en": "transformations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 94.49000000000001,
          "end": 102.99000000000001,
          "en": "So here, we enter a value in degrees, like 45 degrees for example. If we enter this and we save that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 102.99000000000001,
          "end": 103.41,
          "en": "file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 103.44,
          "end": 105.1,
          "en": "let's reload that page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 105.15,
          "end": 110.46000000000001,
          "en": "Now we can see that our badge indeed is rotated by 45 degrees.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 110.7,
          "end": 111.43,
          "en": "Important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 111.47999999999999,
          "end": 114.2,
          "en": "it rotates around the center of the element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 114.24000000000001,
          "end": 120.22,
          "en": "You can change that though, you can change it with the help of the transform origin property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 120.27,
          "end": 125.94,
          "en": "that's the second important property when it comes to normal 2D transformations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 125.94,
          "end": 128.04,
          "en": "By default, this is set to center",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 128.19,
          "end": 135.08,
          "en": "but you can also set it to a value like left or left top and if you would set it to left top for example, watch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 135.09,
          "end": 136.81,
          "en": "this badge if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 137.01,
          "end": 139.24,
          "en": "now it actually seems like it just moved down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 139.26,
          "end": 142.19,
          "en": "but what actually happened is this top left corner,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 142.35,
          "end": 143.97,
          "en": "it stayed in its place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 144,
          "end": 149.52,
          "en": "This is the place where the corner also was before we rotated it because now it's rotating around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 149.57999999999998,
          "end": 150.72,
          "en": "that corner,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 151.07999999999998,
          "end": 155.82,
          "en": "so clockwise around this corner with positive degrees. If we enter negative degrees, it goes in the other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 155.82,
          "end": 156.65,
          "en": "direction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 156.96,
          "end": 160.18,
          "en": "So this is what's happening now, it's rotating around the top left corner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 160.44,
          "end": 168.27,
          "en": "You can also enter a value with pixels or rem to simply move the origin into the element; 0, 0 would",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 168.27,
          "end": 170.24,
          "en": "be the same as top left by the way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 170.31,
          "end": 177.42000000000002,
          "en": "but you can also enter something like 1rem, 1rem to move 1rem to the right and 1rem down from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 177.42000000000002,
          "end": 183.42,
          "en": "the top left corner or a percentage value; 50%, 50% would be equal the center which is the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 183.42,
          "end": 185.59,
          "en": "default and therefore doesn't need to be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 185.67,
          "end": 192.6,
          "en": "but of course you can also specify something like 25%, 50% to move it in 25% and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 192.6,
          "end": 200.01,
          "en": "down 50%, then the origin would be somewhere where the c is probably. Now that is what you can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 200.01,
          "end": 200.6,
          "en": "do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 200.65,
          "end": 202.12,
          "en": "I'll stick to center here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 202.26,
          "end": 206.3,
          "en": "and you don't need to specify transform origin in this case because that's the default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 206.46,
          "end": 208.94,
          "en": "but for the reference, I'll add it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 208.98,
          "end": 214.44,
          "en": "Now with this added, if we reload this, now we're back to the original view where it's just rotated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 214.53,
          "end": 218.22,
          "en": "around the center of the box. Rotating of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 218.22,
          "end": 220.7,
          "en": "is great but it's in the wrong position,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 220.82999999999998,
          "end": 223.41,
          "en": "let's see how we can fix this in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
